    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/public-record/26/grounded/1",
      "@type": [
        "ms:GroundedPublicFact",
        "ms:PublicProjectionNode",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/public-interaction-record/26"
        }
      ],
      "ms:surface": [
        "Held to the lamp, every leaf of the nocturne shows the same heron watermark — the Brell mill's mark."
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/public-record/26/grounded/2",
      "@type": [
        "ms:GroundedPublicFact",
        "ms:PublicProjectionNode",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/public-interaction-record/26"
        }
      ],
      "ms:surface": [
        "The steward's stock-book is plain: heron paper entered the copy-room in the winter of the flood, and the last of it was spent before the thaw. None before, none since."
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/public-record/26/grounded/3",
      "@type": [
        "ms:GroundedPublicFact",
        "ms:PublicProjectionNode",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/public-interaction-record/26"
        }
      ],
      "ms:surface": [
        "The night porter remembers the flood winter well: the copy-room lamps burned past midnight, week upon week, and it was the archive girl, Liane, who kept them burning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/public-record/26/grounded/4",
      "@type": [
        "ms:GroundedPublicFact",
        "ms:PublicProjectionNode",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/public-interaction-record/26"
        }
      ],
      "ms:surface": [
        "Played through once, the nocturne gives up its middle voice: it carries an older tune entire — a cradle-song, set like a keepsake under the right hand's figures."
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/public-record/26/grounded/5",
      "@type": [
        "ms:GroundedPublicFact",
        "ms:PublicProjectionNode",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/public-interaction-record/26"
        }
      ],
      "ms:surface": [
        "Mistress Odile knows the tune at one hearing: the Vara cradle-song, never printed, never performed, sung only within that house's walls."
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/public-record/26/grounded/6",
      "@type": [
        "ms:GroundedPublicFact",
        "ms:PublicProjectionNode",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/public-interaction-record/26"
        }
      ],
      "ms:surface": [
        "Liane was raised within the Vara house — the music-master's orphan, taken in as ward; she grew up under that roof and under its songs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/public-record/26/hypotheses/1",
      "@type": [
        "ms:LearnerHypothesis",
        "ms:PublicProjectionNode",
        "prov:Entity"
      ],
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": [
        {
          "@id": "https://machinespirits.org/derivation/world/world_001_nocturne/public-interaction-record/26"
        }
      ],
      "ms:text": [
        "Liane had both opportunity and access, but the correcting hand is still missing."
      ],
      "ms:turn": [
        23
      ]
    },
